{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07570","headline":"江有枫一篇十章 九 · 萧颖士","name":"江有枫一篇十章 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟，粤鸥与鹭。\n浮湍戏渚，皓然洁素。\n忘其猜妒，彼何人斯，曾足伤惧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}